# Meeva

Read `AGENTS.md` before changing this app.

This folder is the Meeva software-company headquarters and the base template to duplicate for freelance projects.

Products are named `{Product} by meeva` (example: Proactive by meeva in sibling `proactive/`).

Pages stay thin. Brand copy lives in `config/site.ts`. Theme tokens live in `themes/hq.css`.

Do not reintroduce Ashlove healthcare UI. Do not merge the Proactive app into this repo.
